<%- include('components/html-top') -%>
<%- include('components/header', {activePage: 'about'}) -%>
<main class="container">
        <h1 class="main-title">About My Book Tracker</h1>
        <section class="about">
        <p>
            <strong>My Book Tracker</strong> is a simple app created for people who love reading
            and want to keep their books in one place.
        </p>
        <p>
            This project started as a small idea:  
            I wanted an easy way to remember what I’ve read, what I loved,
            and what I plan to read next — without pressure, ratings,
            or endless statistics.
        </p>
        <p>
            Books are personal. This tracker is personal too.
        </p>
        <section>
        <h2>What you can do here</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Store books you’ve read or want to read</li>
            <li>Edit and update your book list</li>
            <li>Remove books when your list changes</li>
            <li>Find books by title or year</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    </section>
</main>
<%- include('components/html-btm') -%>
